        text: 'No. There is no automatic name change on divorce in UAE and no legal obligation to revert to your maiden name. A name reversion is optional. Many women choose to keep their married name, particularly where children share that name. If you do wish to revert, you must actively apply to update your Emirates ID, passport, and other documents.',
      },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
