    question: 'Is there a deadline for updating my documents after divorce in UAE?',
    answer: 'There is no statutory deadline for name reversion. However, your Emirates ID should be updated promptly as it is the primary identity document in UAE, driving with a different name on your licence than your Emirates ID can create complications. Insurance policies, bank accounts, and employment records should be updated within 30-60 days of the divorce to avoid discrepancies that may complicate future transactions.',
